{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27792","headline":"和于中丞登越王楼见寄 · 卢求","name":"和于中丞登越王楼见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高情推谢守，善政属绵州。\n未落紫泥诏，闲登白雪楼。\n晴江如送日，寒岭镇迎秋。\n满壁朝天士，唯予不系舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢求","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}